<title>AUSTRALIA: RALLYING-MAKINEN WINS AUSTRALIAN RALLY AND WORLD TITLE.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-MAKINEN WINS AUSTRALIAN RALLY AND WORLD TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's Tommi Makinen clinched the world championship for the first time when he won the Australian rally on Monday.</p>
<p>Makinen, 32, driving a Mitsubishi, finished ahead of Swede Kenneth Ericksson in a Subaru and Spaniard Carlos Sainz in a Ford Escort.</p>
</text>
